#ASSERT `s 173J(4) the reference includes the virtual form of what it names` `s 173J(4)(k) a representation being read out or a declaration being made at a meeting` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
