#ASSERT `s 173J(4) the reference includes the virtual form of what it names` `s 173J(4)(l) an auditor's report being read before the company in general meeting` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
