#ASSERT `s 173J(4) the reference includes the virtual form of what it names` `s 173J(4)(p) the laying of a statement or other document before a meeting` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
